   "module_16049493631818": {
    "body": {
     "hs_enable_module_padding": true,
     "hs_wrapper_css": {
      "padding-bottom": "20px",
      "padding-left": "20px",
      "padding-right": "20px",
      "padding-top": "25px"
     },
     "html": "<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #000000;\">Hi {{ contact.firstname }},</span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If you\u2019re still thinking about launching (or expanding) your supplement line, this is the point where a clear plan matters more than another idea.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>That\u2019s exactly what our <strong>Private Label Supplements: Client Onboarding</strong> guide gives you.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>In one place, you can see:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Step 1: Discovery Call</strong> \u2013 What we\u2019ll cover, what we\u2019ll ask, and how we match you with a dedicated account rep.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Step 2: Label Design</strong> \u2013 How your branding, compliance needs, and product story come together on the bottle.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Step 3: Order Placement</strong> \u2013 Minimums, timelines, and what to expect from first PO to delivery.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Step 4: Post-Launch Support</strong> \u2013 Inventory, reorders, and ongoing support as your brand grows.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You\u2019ll also get a feel for what it\u2019s like to work with a team that\u2019s been leading the private label space for over 25 years, with <strong>250+ proven formulas</strong> built on high-quality, research-backed ingredients.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If you\u2019ve been waiting for the \u201cright time,\u201d this is your next concrete step.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>\ud83d\udc49<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"> <span style=\"color: #6ca439;\"><a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/en/pl-demo-onboarding-guide\" style=\"color: #6ca439; font-weight: bold;\" rel=\"noopener\">Review the onboarding guide and walk throug</a><a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/en/pl-demo-onboarding-guide\" style=\"color: #6ca439;\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">h the process here</span></a></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Once you\u2019ve had a chance to look it over, you can schedule your discovery call and we\u2019ll map out your launch, timeline, and ideal starting SKUs together.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
    "child_css": {},
    "css": {},
